# state: returning   (classifier-path reopen using the kept golden profile; #433 step 6d)
# Dungeons & Dragons Heroes (49470013): a `returning` variant of
# dnd-heroes.route (first-run) for a disk that already has the kept
# profile/save. The profile gate refuses a repeat first-run creation (R1:
# the title already has a kept profile); this route opens with `drive
# generic` instead of the first-run's blind boot-to-name-entry-to-cutscene
# sequence, replaying the menus with the trained classifier until play is
# confirmed, then marks. Player control is unchanged from the first-run
# route: LY min walked the fighter down the screen, A and X attacked (X also
# opens the skill list, so the play pattern presses A only).
drive generic 300 mark
repeat forever {
    axis LY min
    wait 2
    press A
    axis LX max
    wait 1
    press A
    axis LX mid
    axis LY max
    wait 2
    press A
    axis LX min
    wait 1
    press A
    axis LX mid
    axis LY mid
    wait 0.5
}
